# Unit test folder structure

All Vitest tests live under **`src/__tests__/__folder__/`** — never colocated beside source.

| Source | Tests |
|--------|-------|
| `src/lib/…` | `src/__tests__/__lib__/…` |
| `src/services/…` | `src/__tests__/__services__/…` |
| `src/components/shared/ui/…` | `src/__tests__/__ui__/…` |
| `src/app/…` | `src/__tests__/__app__/…` |

See `.cursor/skills/testing/SKILL.md`.
